small-scale fumigant approaches that can be evaluated only inside instrumented
greenhouse test chambers. The overarching theme is eco-efficiency, cost-effectiveness,
and the ability to conduct controlled bench-scale experimentation without relying
on imported commercial products.

Your task is to write a detailed, technically precise research proposal that the
lab can use as an internal protocol document.

IMPORTANT IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENT:
